# armour/woman/mail_sleeve_r: Mail's sleeve over the arm: the upper arm in the mail brick to the elbow
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; armour and helms to P2c's ARMOUR / HELMS). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# WOMAN-WEAR (P2B rollout, 2026-10-22): every side arm key the clips name (runB runF pB pM pF pK pN, guard; the far arm's
# pump keys): the arm's upper arm and forearm in the mail brick (W1: no more bare tunic sleeves in the run or drawn frames).
use person
body woman
role armour mail
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys armR
side R
z 1

